// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The QC program: every layer and every check, in dependency order.
//
// Included by both entry points -- ontology-qc.dl (the build check, reading
// go-edit.facts) and ontology-qc-selftest.dl (the control-facts self-test) --
// so the two can never drift apart on which checks they run. Neither entry
// point declares checks of its own; they differ only in input and output.
//
// A new topic file goes in the list at the bottom.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

